Third-party notice

Hue Connect is written from Signify's Philips Hue developer documentation (the
CLIP API v2 reference and the Application Design Guidance). Philips Hue is a
trademark of Signify; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Signify. The documentation itself is not included in this repository.

Design ideas were learned from these projects; no code is copied from them:

- aiohue (Home Assistant's Hue library), Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/aiohue : reconnecting the event
  stream with Last-Event-ID, refetching only after a long gap, retrying 429
  and 503 with a growing wait.
- CoCoHue by Robert Morris, Apache License 2.0,
  https://github.com/HubitatCommunity/CoCoHue : how a Hue integration fits
  Hubitat (the hub's mDNS cache, the event stream interface).

The RGB/xy colour conversion follows the formulas in Hue's "Color Conversion
Formulas RGB to XY and back" design note.
